<title>USA: Chancellor Corp year loss widens.</title>
<headline>Chancellor Corp year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>year ended Dec. 31</p>
<p>			  1996			   1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.32     loss	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss		   6,804     loss	 1,221</p>
<p> Revs			 5,513		    8,491</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The loss for fiscal 1996 was due in part to restructuring charges related to a change in management, severance package compensation and professional fees paid as a consequence of restructuring and transition efforts.</p>
<p>Restructuring charges contributed $0.10 per share to the 1996 fiscal loss.  Operating loss for the company was $1.37 a share, before consideration of a tax benefit of $0.05 per share.</p>
</text>
